          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tightened trade measures (tariffs/quotas) raise trade frictions and settlement risk, causing foreign counterparties and investors to scale back portfolio and trade-finance exposures to affected markets, reducing net cross-border capital inflows into fixed-income assets." />
