          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter trade policies (tariffs/quotas on vehicles and related tech) push up import and component costs, which are quickly transmitted to dealer and input prices and lift market and survey inflation expectations for the coming year." />
