          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened China‑West geopolitical tension drives surges in physical gold buying and off‑exchange settlement requests while dealers widen spreads and reduce inventory, making it harder to execute very large gold trades (i.e., reducing observable market liquidity)." />
