          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained high oil prices erode industrial competitiveness and provoke political pressure to protect domestic auto/tech industries, prompting policymakers to introduce tighter trade measures (tariffs, quotas, local-content rules) over the policy cycle." />
