          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained oil price increases boost hydrocarbon export revenues and liquidity for regional states and patrons, enabling them to finance larger-scale or more sustained military responses and logistics support for interdiction or retaliation." />
