          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained higher crude prices raise export revenues and fiscal receipts for energy exporters (notably Russia), directly increasing available funding for fuel, munitions, logistics and troop sustainment and thereby enabling a higher tempo of kinetic operations." />
